---
import SectionTitle from './SectionTitle.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const recent = [['A Static Home for a Living Archive', '/posts/welcome/', 'Sep 21, 2026'], ['Research Has Its Own Backpropagation', '/posts/research-backpropagation/', 'Sep 17, 2026']];
---
<aside class="right-sidebar">
  <section class="author-card sidebar-panel"><div class="author-cover"></div><div class="author-body"><img class="author-avatar" src={`${base}images/avatar.svg`} alt="Haibin" /><div class="author-name">haibin <span>SUSTech</span></div><p class="author-bio">Systems research, LLMs, academic life, and ordinary days.</p><div class="author-stats"><div><strong>2</strong><span>Articles</span></div><div><strong>0</strong><span>Comments</span></div><div><strong>—</strong><span>Views</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="sidebar-panel recent-panel"><SectionTitle>Recent Update</SectionTitle>{recent.map(([title, href, date]) => <a class="recent-item" href={`${base}${href.replace(/^\//, '')}`}><div class="recent-thumb"></div><div><strong>{title}</strong><time>{date}</time></div></a>)}</section>
  <section class="sidebar-panel passage-panel"><SectionTitle>Passage</SectionTitle><p>“The future is discovered through the work that survives contact with reality.”</p></section>
</aside>
